<!-- 
Instructions for deployment:
1. Copy this file to public/sitemap.xml
2. Update all "your-domain.com" to your actual domain
3. Update lastmod dates when content changes
4. Update profile image URL if using different image
5. Submit to Google Search Console: https://search.google.com/search-console
6. Submit to Bing Webmaster Tools: https://www.bing.com/webmasters
7. Rebuild and redeploy

Priority guidelines:
- 1.0: Homepage (most important)
- 0.8: Major sections (projects, publications)
- 0.5-0.7: Secondary pages
- 0.1-0.4: Utility pages

Changefreq guidelines:
- daily: News, blog posts
- weekly: Frequently updated content
- monthly: Regular updates (CV sections)
- yearly: Static content (contact info)
-->
